  - destruct MODE as (_ & Hn & H1). rewrite KBW. exact (art_wmx_creditW c w u n Hc H1 (HREG eq_refl)).
  - destruct MODE as (AC1 & AC2). unfold adebit. apply (art_wmx_creditR c w u n kb _ _ Hc KBW); lia.
Qed.
