Qed.

#[using="FSG rn G M qz rs qr nd q msz kb nch REP Erz16 Hqz Ers Hrs Hsec End Hq Emsz Edep GRANT GLIVE"] Lemma art_lrep_blocks_apart : blocks_apart u n LB.
